an class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0—</span></span></span></span></span>18K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mtext>—</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0—</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0—</span></span></span></span></span>18K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>年度奖金</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>0—20%</td>\n<td>0—20%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>解读：</strong> Level 57—58 是实习生和合同工级别，正式全职工程师通常从 Level 59 开始。Level 59 的入职股票范围极大（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>—</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15K—</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">—</span></span></span></span></span>120K），反映了不同团队和候选人竞争力的巨大差异。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高级工程师-level-60-63\">高级工程师（Level 60—63）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>Level 60</th>\n<th>Level 61</th>\n<th>Level 62</th>\n<th>Level 63</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基本工资（主）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>110.2</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>—</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">110.2K—</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"